# Media and logs stay out of git — too large, often copyrighted.
# media/ is regenerated by `node evaluation-files/generate-assets.mjs` (ffmpeg test patterns);
# the corpus source footage lives at the top of evaluation-files/ and stays local-only.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
*.log
.venv/
# Runner keeps appending; never commit the live log or mid-run journal.
runner.log
*.rows.jsonl
# Temp / scratch
*.png
*.txt
.DS_Store

# Root .gitignore blocks `evaluation-files/baseline-*.json` and `evaluation-files/plans/`
# ("never committed") — that rule predates the decision to commit this corpus as a
# self-contained handoff. Re-include the small evidence artifacts; media stays out above.
!baseline-*.json
!plans/
